n></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">service</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transition</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是资本折现率（通常取 8-12%），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>switching</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{switching}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">switching</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是锁定成本（在合同终止时一次性支付）。</p>\n<p>各路径的隐性成本陷阱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>常被低估的成本项</th>\n<th>经验倍率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自建</td>\n<td>人才流失后的知识重建成本</td>\n<td>初始估算的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外购</td>\n<td>供应商年度涨价 + 深度定制费用</td>\n<td>首年许可费的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}4\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>（5 年）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合作</td>\n<td>API 变更引发的适配工作 + 利润分成</td>\n<td>年服务费的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1.8</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3\\text{-}1.8\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ai-时代的决策修正\">AI 时代的决策修正</h2><p>2026 年，AI 能力的获取方式正在重塑 Build-Buy-Partner 的传统逻辑：</p>\n<p><strong>基础模型层</strong>：已高度商品化。OpenAI GPT-4o、Anthropic Claude、Google Gemini 的 API 定价持续下降（2025-2026 年间下降约 60-70%）。除非有极端的数据主权或延迟要求，外购是默认选择。</p>\n<p><strong>应用编排层</strong>：处于 Custom 阶段。Agent 框架（LangGraph、CrewAI、AutoGen）虽然提供了起点，但业务逻辑的编排仍需大量定制。这一层的最优策略是自建核心编排 + 集成开源框架组件。</p>\n<p><strong>领域知识层</strong>：组织独有的知识（内部文档、流程、客户数据）是不可购买的。这一层只有自建一条路——通过 RAG、微调或 Context Engineering 将领域知识注入模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Buy(商品化)&quot;&#10;        FM[基础模型 API]&#10;        Infra[GPU 云算力]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Partner(半定制)&quot;&#10;        Framework[Agent 框架集成]&#10;        Vector[向量数据库服务]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Build(差异化)&quot;&#10;        Orchestration[业务 Agent 编排]&#10;        Domain[领域知识管道]&#10;        Eval[评估与护栏系统]&#10;    end&#10;    Domain --&gt; Orchestration&#10;    Framework --&gt; Orchestration&#10;    FM --&gt; Orchestration&#10;    Vector --&gt; Domain&#10;    Infra --&gt; FM\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Buy(商品化)\"\n        FM[基础模型 API]\n        Infra[GPU 云算力]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Partner(半定制)\"\n        Framework[Agent 框架集成]\n        Vector[向量数据库服务]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Build(差异化)\"\n        Orchestration[业务 Agent 编排]\n        Domain[领域知识管道]\n        Eval[评估与护栏系统]\n    end\n    Domain --&gt; Orchestration\n    Framework --&gt; Orchestration\n    FM --&gt; Orchestration\n    Vector --&gt; Domain\n    Infra --&gt; FM</pre><h2 id=\"决策矩阵实操模板\">决策矩阵实操模板</h2><p>将评估维度量化为评分，支持跨方案的结构化比较：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>自建得分</th>\n<th>外购得分</th>\n<th>合作得分</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>战略控制力</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>对路线图的掌控程度（1-10）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上市速度</td>\n<td>0.20</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>达到 MVP 的月数取反</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 年 TCO</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>成本排序得分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术风险</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>交付确定性（1-10）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退出灵活性</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>切换成本取反</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>加权总分</strong></td>\n<td><strong>1.00</strong></td>\n<td><strong>6.05</strong></td>\n<td><strong>5.65</strong></td>\n<td><strong>6.45</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>上表为示意。实际评分需要基于具体场景的定量分析，而非凭感觉打分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"决策后的治理机制\">决策后的治理机制</h2><p>做出决策只是起点。三种路径各自需要不同的持续治理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自建后</strong>：建立<a href=\"foundations/technology-lifecycle-management\">技术生命周期管理</a>机制，定期评估维护成本是否超过重建阈值</li>\n<li><strong>外购后</strong>：监控供应商健康度（融资状况、路线图对齐度、SLA 合规率），定义退出预案的触发条件</li>\n<li><strong>合作后</strong>：设置合同复审节奏（至少年度），跟踪 API 变更频率和向后兼容性承诺</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最危险的状态是&quot;决策后失忆&quot;——做出选择后就再也不重新评估。市场条件会变化（供应商被收购、开源替代方案成熟、内部能力增长），<a href=\"radar-methodology/radar-governance-cadence\">技术雷达的治理节奏</a>为这种持续重评估提供了制度化的时间窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式清单\">反模式清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NIH 综合征</td>\n<td>一切都要自建，包括登录系统和邮件服务</td>\n<td>工程师偏好有趣的技术挑战</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商绑架</td>\n<td>所有关键系统都跑在单一供应商上，合同谈判毫无筹码</td>\n<td>初期贪图集成便利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合作幻觉</td>\n<td>名义上是合作伙伴关系，实际上是外包+加价</td>\n<td>未明确 IP 归属与退出条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>永久试点</td>\n<td>同时有 5 个 PoC 在跑，没有一个进入生产</td>\n<td>决策瘫痪 / 规避责任</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>避免这些反模式的关键是将决策过程制度化（定期复审 + 量化评估），而非依赖个人英雄式判断。<a href=\"foundations/tech-strategy-frameworks\">技术战略框架</a>中的组合管理矩阵提供了制度化的工具支撑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Build-Buy-Partner 不是一次性决策，而是需要持续重评估的动态过程。核心决策依据是三维度评估（战略重要性 × 市场成熟度 × 组织就绪度），量化基础是 5 年 TCO 模型而非初始成本比较。AI 时代重塑了各层的默认选择——基础模型外购、编排逻辑自建、领域知识不可购买。最重要的原则是：决策后持续治理，每年重新审视假设是否仍然成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自建、外购与合作决策","id":"自建-外购与合作决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"决策三维度评估模型","id":"决策三维度评估模型"},{"level":2,"text":"总拥有成本模型","id":"总拥有成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 时代的决策修正","id":"ai-时代的决策修正"},{"level":2,"text":"决策矩阵实操模板","id":"决策矩阵实操模板"},{"level":2,"text":"决策后的治理机制","id":"决策后的治理机制"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式清单","id":"反模式清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"技术战略框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/tech-strategy-frameworks"},"next":{"title":"技术生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/technology-lifecycle-management"}}